{
  "info": {
    "name": "Smart Parking Management System",
    "_postman_id": "spms-coursework-2026",
    "description": "Complete REST API collection for the Smart Parking Management System (SPMS).\n\nAll business requests are routed through the API Gateway using the `{{baseUrl}}` collection variable (default http://localhost:8080) - do not call the microservices directly. The final Infrastructure folder points at Eureka (8761) and the Config Server (8888) for infrastructure testing only.\n\nFolders:\n1. User Service    - register, login, get, update\n2. Vehicle Service - create, get, list by user, update, entry, exit\n3. Parking Service - create space, get spaces, search (city/zone/available), update space, update status\n4. Reservation     - create, get, list by user, cancel, release\n5. Payment Service - create, get, reservation/user lookups, receipt\n6. Error Cases     - expected 4xx/5xx responses\n7. Infrastructure  - Eureka dashboard/registry and actuator health checks",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
